 tight,\nhere comes the wolf, he owns the night.\nSleep tight, sleep tight:\nshe is the wolf… and I'll wait by the door.\n\n[Verse 2]\nShe's got a map of sins written down her back,\nevery kiss a debt that I can't pay back.\nIf I get lost in her woods, don't come find me:\nsome cages have open doors and you still can't leave.\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nIf heaven wants to punish me for wanting her this way,\nwrite my name on the list — I signed it anyway.\n\n[Chorus]\nSleep tight, sleep tight,\nhere comes the wolf, he owns the night.\nSleep tight, sleep tight:\nshe is the wolf… and she's coming for me.\nSleep tight, sleep tight,\nhere comes the wolf, he owns the night.\nSleep tight, sleep tight:\nshe is the wolf… and I'll wait by the door.\n\n[Bridge]\nIf this is a story, it ends in the dark —\nbut nobody sleeps wanting to wake up.\n(whispered) Sleep tight…\n\n[Final Chorus]\nSleep tight, sleep tight,\nhere comes the wolf, he owns the night.\nSleep tight, sleep tight:\nshe is the wolf… and she's coming for me.", "datos": [["Publicada", "10/11/2026"], ["Plataformas", "24 (Spotify, Apple Music, YouTube Music y más)"], ["UPC", "700087980560"], ["ISRC", "QTAF32623981"], ["Distribuidora", "DistroKid"]], "estadisticas": [["Video oficial (YouTube)", "97 vistas · 17/11/2026"], ["Lyric Video (YouTube)", "97 vistas · 17/11/2026"], ["Curadores", "Aprobada por «Lonely & Broke» (Daily Playlists, 17/11)"], ["Canvas de Spotify", "Lobo y luna (HyperFrames) — en vivo desde el 17/11"]], "enlaces": [["Spotify — la canción", "https://open.spotify.com/track/4ZXgGz85mxeGNxLsi260Kt"], ["Video oficial (YouTube)", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=py4pD7H1vk4"], ["Lyric Video (YouTube)", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B5X3S4CW94U"], ["SoundCloud", "https://soundcloud.com/lastcallofficial"]]}, "Wide Awake": {"letra": "# Receta: dark pop tipo Stellar — Fa menor, 130 BPM, voz pop suave con falsete, Persona «Voz Dark ML».\n# Estado: letra aprobada para generar tomas de escucha; SIN subir a DistroKid sin aprobación expresa de Brayan.\n\n[Verse 1]\nI sang you off to sleep each night\nNow the song is stuck in me\nCounting cracks up on the ceiling\nWhere your shadow used to be\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\nThe moon is red, the house is cold\nI did this — or so I'm told\n\n[Chorus]\nNow I'm wide awake\nWhile you're sleeping fine\nI gave you all my dreams\nAnd you took your time\nNow I'm wide awake\nWith the mess we made\nSleep tight, love —\nI'm the one who pays\n\n[Verse 2]\nYour pillow still remembers you\nBetter than I ever will\nI close my eyes, you're standing there\nQuiet, darker, still\n\n[Bridge]\nHush now, don't you cry\nThat's what I sang — what a lie\nHush now, close your eyes\nI'm the ghost this time", "datos": [["Sale", "Viernes 27/11/2026 · 12:00 AM ET"], ["Plataformas", "24 tiendas (DistroKid)"], ["UPC", "700081377557"], ["ISRC", "QTAF72609135"], ["Pre-save", "Activo (HyperFollow)"], ["Distribuidora", "DistroKid"]], "estadisticas": [["Video oficial", "Listo — se publica el mismo día 27/11"], ["Serie promo", "7 piezas HyperFrames (01 y 02 públicas, 03–07 programadas)"], ["Pitch editorial Spotify", "En reintento — Spotify aún no la lista (17/11)"]], "enlaces": [["Pre-save (HyperFollow)", "https://distrokid.com/hyperfollow/lastcall14/wide-awake"], ["YouTube — canal oficial", "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSGx55RnqxXjk1WY1Lo4jYQ"]]}}, "revision": "2026-11-18 20:33 ET"}